Today is Wednesday.
The time is half past five in the evening.
Anitha and I are in a cafe in Panampilly Nagar.
I came to Kochi in January.
This is a small celebration.
We sit in the cafe and drink hot coffee.
Anitha always drinks black coffee.
Sometimes I drink tea.
But today, I am also drinking coffee.
It is very busy in the cafe.
Every day in the evening, a lot of people come here.
Anitha asks, "Do you like Kochi now, Maya?"
I smile.
"Yes, I like Kochi very much," I reply.
We talk about many things.
At seven o'clock at night, I need to go pick up my bicycle.
Therefore, we leave the cafe at half past six.
This time gives me a lot of happiness.
